> If envt = "abs", the returned envelope is the absolute value of the wave (from the vignette). So if your input wave is in uV, the returned envelope is also uV (abs. val.). If you're interested in determining sound pressure levels (in dB), you first need to convert from voltage to pressure using a sensitivity value, and then 20*log10(p/p0)
